supervisor.py adapts the participant/task lifecycle structure. It replaces
AgentSession startup with consent-gated, per-track raw audio supervision.
Changes include registered pending tasks, cancellation-safe cleanup, source
and consent epochs, no draining after pause, no transcript logging, and no
shared transcript publication. The provider adapters are original code using
maintained SDKs. Other source snapshots remain read-only research references.
